Sokoban is near the Oracle.  The statues in the Oracle level yield vast
numbers of rocks.  This is no coincidence to me.  I will lug a large
stack of rocks to near the stairs up to Sokoban.  The first monster I
encounter blocking a boulder I go get 50-100 rocks.  Overkill is no big
deal as there is plenty of time and plenty of rocks.  Under kill is a
big deal as the monster heals as you go for more rocks.

I learned that about rocks liking a mine town priest once.  If you run
out of rocks before the mine tow priest is dead you didn't shuttle 200+
rocks to your dug out area and thus didn't bring enough rocks and other
missiles.

Not that magic missile is a bad idea, just that those rocks appear in
every game.


